---
permalink: "results.html"
i18nKey: "results"
bodyClass: "page-results"
title: "Final Results · EBiM Benchmark"
description: "Final rankings of the EBiM Benchmark Competition 2026 on the real robot, with evaluation videos of the top three teams in Tasks 2 and 3."
canonical: "https://ebim-benchmark.github.io/results.html"
headComments: true
backToTop: true
navActive: "competition"
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block headStructured %}
  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:type"        content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name"   content="EBiM Benchmark" />
